        "reason": "The main policy comparison is correct, but the added definite North exemption for under-16 visitors is not explicitly established by the positive requirement for visitors 16 or older. A closed-world reading of that policy could imply exemption, so this stricter source-grounding judgment is flagged for sensitivity review."
      },
